terminal appeal-window-missed: "Appeal Forfeited — FRAP 4(b) Deadline Missed" outcome [loss, conviction, procedural-default, waiver-trap] cite "Fed. R. App. P. 4(b); Eberhart v. United States, 546 U.S. 12 (2005)"
